  "CROSS-TRANSACTION CONSISTENCY": "COMHSHEASMHACHT IDIR IDIRBHEARTA",
  "A token operation is not one transaction. Approval, vesting setup and distribution are separate transactions. Solana is atomic within a transaction — not across a sequence. When a later step fails, the earlier ones stay on-chain.": "Ní idirbheart amháin í oibríocht comhartha. Is idirbhearta ar leith iad ceadú, socrú vesting agus dáileadh. Tá Solana adamhach laistigh d'idirbheart — ní thar shraith. Nuair a theipeann ar chéim níos déanaí, fanann na cinn roimhe ar an slabhra.",
  "This runs the sequence with real SPL token transfers, and on failure executes real on-chain compensating transactions for the steps already completed. Nothing is deleted — a chain cannot delete. Each compensation is a new, independently verifiable transaction, and the token balances return to where they started.": "Ritheann an taispeántas seo an tsraith le haistrithe fíora comharthaí SPL, agus má theipeann air, cuireann sé fíor-idirbhearta cúitimh i gcrích ar an slabhra do na céimeanna atá críochnaithe cheana. Ní scriostar aon rud — ní féidir le slabhra scriosadh. Is idirbheart nua is féidir a fhíorú go neamhspleách é gach cúiteamh, agus filleann iarmhéideanna na gcomharthaí ar an áit ar thosaigh siad.",
  "WATCH THE DEMO VIDEO": "FÉACH AR FHÍSEÁN AN TAISPEÁNTAIS",
  "Opens on YouTube in a new tab": "Osclaítear ar YouTube i gcluaisín nua",
  "DEMO VIDEO — COMING SOON": "FÍSEÁN AN TAISPEÁNTAIS — AG TEACHT GO LUATH",
  "A guided walkthrough of this page will be posted here.": "Foilseofar turas treoraithe ar an leathanach seo anseo.",
  "EXIT FULL SCREEN": "SCOIR DEN LÁNSCÁILEÁN",
  "iPhone Safari cannot hide its bars for web pages. For full screen: tap Share, choose Add to Home Screen, then open this page from the new icon.": "Ní féidir le Safari ar iPhone a bharraí a cheilt ar leathanaigh ghréasáin. Le haghaidh lánscáileáin: tapáil Comhroinn, roghnaigh Cuir leis an Scáileán Baile, agus ansin oscail an leathanach seo ón deilbhín nua.",
  "HOW TO USE THIS DEMO": "CONAS AN TAISPEÁNTAS SEO A ÚSÁID",
  "INSTALL PHANTOM": "SUITEÁIL PHANTOM",
  "Install the Phantom browser extension and create a wallet. The demo uses only the devnet test network — never real funds.": "Suiteáil an breiseán brabhsálaí Phantom agus cruthaigh sparán. Ní úsáideann an taispeántas ach an líonra tástála devnet — ní úsáidtear airgead fíor riamh.",
  "SWITCH TO DEVNET": "ATHRAIGH GO DEVNET",
  "In Phantom: Settings → Developer Settings → set the network to Solana Devnet.": "In Phantom: Socruithe → Socruithe Forbróra → socraigh an líonra go Solana Devnet.",
  "GET TEST SOL": "FAIGH SOL TÁSTÁLA",
  "Get free devnet SOL from any faucet, e.g. faucet.solana.com. It has no monetary value.": "Faigh SOL devnet saor in aisce ó aon faucet, m.sh. faucet.solana.com. Níl aon luach airgid aige.",
  "CONNECT WALLET": "NASC SPARÁN",
  "Click CONNECT in the wallet panel below and approve in Phantom.": "Cliceáil NASC sa phainéal sparáin thíos agus ceadaigh in Phantom.",
  "RUN SETUP": "RITH AN SOCRÚ",
  "Click RUN SETUP to mint a test token and open the accounts. Approve both Phantom prompts. Costs about 0.02 devnet SOL.": "Cliceáil RITH AN SOCRÚ chun comhartha tástála a mhionú agus na cuntais a oscailt. Ceadaigh an dá iarratas Phantom. Cosnaíonn sé thart ar 0.02 SOL devnet.",
  "CHOOSE FAILURE MODE": "ROGHNAIGH MÓD TEIPE",
  "Choose NONE to run all three steps, or FAIL AT 2 / 3 to force a failure and watch the completed steps get compensated on-chain. FAIL AT 1 fails before any transaction is sent, so there is nothing to compensate. Then click EXECUTE FLOW.": "Roghnaigh DADA chun na trí chéim a rith, nó TEIP AG 2 / 3 chun teip a chur i bhfeidhm agus féachaint ar na céimeanna críochnaithe á gcúiteamh ar an slabhra. Teipeann TEIP AG 1 sula seoltar aon idirbheart, mar sin níl aon rud le cúiteamh. Ansin cliceáil RITH AN SREABHADH.",
  "WATCH & VERIFY": "FÉACH AGUS FÍORAIGH",
  "Watch the step panel and the TOKEN ACCOUNTS balances. Every signature links to Solscan for independent verification.": "Féach ar phainéal na gcéimeanna agus ar iarmhéideanna na gCUNTAS COMHARTHAÍ. Nascann gach síniú le Solscan le haghaidh fíorú neamhspleách.",
  "DOWNLOAD THE LOG": "ÍOSLÓDÁIL AN LOGA",
  "Every run is saved in this browser and survives a refresh. Click DOWNLOAD LOG for a text record or DOWNLOAD CSV for a spreadsheet; CLEAR removes the saved runs.": "Sábháiltear gach rith sa bhrabhsálaí seo agus maireann sé tar éis athnuachana. Cliceáil ÍOSLÓDÁIL LOGA le haghaidh taifead téacs nó ÍOSLÓDÁIL CSV le haghaidh scarbhileog; baineann GLAN na rití sábháilte.",
  "If a step shows a retry or waiting message, do not click or refresh — the engine checks transaction status and recovers on its own. Keep the Phantom panel open during a run; Phantom locks itself after about 15 minutes of inactivity.": "Má thaispeánann céim teachtaireacht athiarrachta nó feithimh, ná cliceáil agus ná hathnuaigh — seiceálann an t-inneall stádas an idirbhirt agus téarnaíonn sé leis féin. Coinnigh painéal Phantom oscailte le linn rite; glasálann Phantom é féin tar éis thart ar 15 nóiméad gan ghníomhaíocht.",
  "WALLET": "SPARÁN",
  "SETUP": "SOCRÚ",
  "FAILURE INJECTION": "INSTEALLADH TEIPE",
  "RUN": "RITH",
  "RUN LOG": "LOGA RITE",
  "CONNECT": "NASC",
  "RE-RUN SETUP": "ATHRITH AN SOCRÚ",
  "EXECUTE FLOW": "RITH AN SREABHADH",
