  "BALANCE CHECK: FAIL": "SEICEÁIL IARMHÉIDE: TEIPTHE",
  "BALANCE CHECK: N/A": "SEICEÁIL IARMHÉIDE: N/B",
  "+ {0} earlier run(s) in the downloads": "+ {0} rith níos luaithe sna híoslódálacha",
  "Demo updated:": "Taispeántas nuashonraithe:",
  "— run history saved in the browser, CSV export, and a per-run balance check.": "— stair na rití sábháilte sa bhrabhsálaí, easpórtáil CSV agus seiceáil iarmhéide do gach rith.",
  "Creates a test SPL token, mints {0} to your account, and opens an escrow and a recipient account. Two wallet prompts. Needed once before running the flow.": "Cruthaíonn sé comhartha tástála SPL, mionaíonn sé {0} chuig do chuntas, agus osclaíonn sé cuntas coimeádta (escrow) agus cuntas faighteora. Dhá iarratas sparáin. Riachtanach uair amháin roimh an sreabhadh a rith.",
  "NONE": "DADA",
  "FAIL AT {0}": "TEIP AG {0}",
  "Force a step to fail, to demonstrate compensation.": "Cuir iallach ar chéim teip, chun an cúiteamh a léiriú.",
  "Flow ID:": "Aitheantas sreafa:",
  "Every saved run, with signatures, balances and a balance check. Saved in this browser only and kept after a refresh. Downloads are in English: a text log or a CSV spreadsheet.": "Gach rith sábháilte, le sínithe, iarmhéideanna agus seiceáil iarmhéide. Sábháilte sa bhrabhsálaí seo amháin agus coinnithe tar éis athnuachana. Tá na híoslódálacha i mBéarla: loga téacs nó scarbhileog CSV.",
  "No Phantom wallet detected. Install the Phantom extension and switch it to Devnet.": "Níor aimsíodh sparán Phantom. Suiteáil an breiseán Phantom agus athraigh go Devnet é.",
  "Wallet connected. Make sure Phantom is set to Devnet.": "Sparán nasctha. Cinntigh go bhfuil Phantom socraithe go Devnet.",
