  "Running…": "Ar siúl…",
  "Not enough Devnet SOL for fees. Request more at faucet.solana.com and try again.": "Níl go leor SOL Devnet ann do tháillí. Iarr tuilleadh ag faucet.solana.com agus bain triail eile as.",
  "Your token account holds {0}, and this flow moves {1}. Run SETUP again to mint a fresh allocation.": "Tá {0} i do chuntas comharthaí, agus bogann an sreabhadh seo {1}. Rith an SOCRÚ arís chun leithdháileadh nua a mhionú.",
  "All three steps completed. Every transaction is verifiable on Solscan.": "Críochnaíodh na trí chéim. Is féidir gach idirbheart a fhíorú ar Solscan.",
  "A step failed. Completed steps were compensated automatically — each compensation is a real on-chain transaction.": "Theip ar chéim. Cúitíodh na céimeanna críochnaithe go huathoibríoch — is fíor-idirbheart ar an slabhra é gach cúiteamh.",
  "A step failed and compensation did not complete. Manual intervention required.": "Theip ar chéim agus níor críochnaíodh an cúiteamh. Tá idirghabháil láimhe ag teastáil.",
  "Unexpected error:": "Earráid gan choinne:",
  "TOKEN ACCOUNTS": "CUNTAIS CHOMHARTHAÍ",
  "Real SPL token accounts on Solana devnet. Balances update after every run. Each flow moves {0} tokens.": "Fíorchuntais chomharthaí SPL ar Solana devnet. Nuashonraítear iarmhéideanna tar éis gach rite. Bogann gach sreabhadh {0} comhartha.",
