  "— all three steps executed successfully.": "— cuireadh na trí chéim i gcrích go rathúil.",
  "FAILED AND COMPENSATED": "THEIP AGUS CÚITÍODH",
  "— a step failed; every completed step was compensated by a real on-chain transaction, in reverse order. The final state matches the starting state. The transaction history does not disappear, and it should not: it is the audit trail.": "— theip ar chéim; cúitíodh gach céim chríochnaithe le fíor-idirbheart ar an slabhra, in ord droim ar ais. Tá an staid deiridh mar an gcéanna leis an staid tosaigh. Ní imíonn stair na n-idirbheart, agus níor chóir di: is í rian an iniúchta í.",
  "COMPENSATION INCOMPLETE": "CÚITEAMH NEAMHIOMLÁN",
