  "Generate a payment order in three steps: choose the service and amount, choose how you want to pay, and get the exact payment details with your order number.": "Cruthaigh ordú íocaíochta i dtrí chéim: roghnaigh an tseirbhís agus an tsuim, roghnaigh conas is mian leat íoc, agus faigh na sonraí íocaíochta beachta le d'uimhir ordaithe.",
