  "PAY BY BANK WIRE": "ÍOC LE HAISTRIÚ BAINC",
  "Send the wire from your bank using the details below, and quote the order number in the wire reference / payment details field. Incoming international wires can take 1–5 business days.": "Seol an t-aistriú ó do bhanc ag úsáid na sonraí thíos, agus luaigh an uimhir ordaithe i réimse na tagartha / na sonraí íocaíochta. D'fhéadfadh 1–5 lá gnó a thógáil ar aistrithe idirnáisiúnta isteach.",
  "Wire reference": "Tagairt an aistrithe",
  "PAY BY INTERAC E-TRANSFER": "ÍOC LE INTERAC E-TRANSFER",
  "In your Canadian online banking, send an Interac e-Transfer for the order amount to the email below, and put the order number in the transfer message. Autodeposit is enabled — no security question is needed and the payment is deposited automatically.": "I do bhaincéireacht ar líne Cheanadach, seol Interac e-Transfer ar shuim an ordaithe chuig an ríomhphost thíos, agus cuir an uimhir ordaithe i dteachtaireacht an aistrithe. Tá Autodeposit cumasaithe — níl aon cheist slándála ag teastáil agus taiscítear an íocaíocht go huathoibríoch.",
  "Send to": "Seol chuig",
  "Transfer message": "Teachtaireacht an aistrithe",
  "PAY IN USDT": "ÍOC IN USDT",
  "For your security, USDT deposit addresses are issued per order by email — never published on this website. Click the button below to request the address; we reply with the address and network. Verify the address by email before sending: cryptocurrency transfers cannot be reversed.": "Ar mhaithe le do shlándáil, eisítear seoltaí taisce USDT in aghaidh an ordaithe trí ríomhphost — ní fhoilsítear riamh iad ar an suíomh seo. Cliceáil an cnaipe thíos chun an seoladh a iarraidh; freagróimid leis an seoladh agus an líonra. Fíoraigh an seoladh trí ríomhphost sula seolann tú: ní féidir aistrithe criptea-airgeadra a aisiompú.",
  "Amount": "Suim",
  "✉ EMAIL US THIS ORDER": "✉ SEOL AN T-ORDÚ SEO CHUGAINN TRÍ RÍOMHPHOST",
  "✉ REQUEST USDT ADDRESS": "✉ IARR SEOLADH USDT",
  "COPY": "CÓIPEÁIL",
  "Interac e-Transfer works in Canadian dollars only, so the currency has been switched to CAD. Please enter the amount in CAD.": "Ní oibríonn Interac e-Transfer ach i ndollair Cheanada, mar sin athraíodh an t-airgeadra go CAD. Iontráil an tsuim in CAD.",
  "No email app? Send the order details to": "Gan aip ríomhphoist? Seol sonraí an ordaithe chuig",
  "PAY NOW IN YOUR BANK": "ÍOC ANOIS I DO BHANC",
  "1. Your order number has been copied.": "1. Cóipeáladh d'uimhir ordaithe.",
  "2. Open your bank below and sign in.": "2. Oscail do bhanc thíos agus sínigh isteach.",
  "3. Choose Interac e-Transfer → Send money. Recipient: info@cosmosledgerlabs.com. Amount: the order amount. Message: paste the order number.": "3. Roghnaigh Interac e-Transfer → Seol airgead. Faighteoir: info@cosmosledgerlabs.com. Suim: suim an ordaithe. Teachtaireacht: greamaigh an uimhir ordaithe.",
  "COPY ORDER NUMBER AGAIN": "CÓIPEÁIL AN UIMHIR ORDAITHE ARÍS",
  "Other bank or credit union: open your own online banking or banking app.": "Banc eile nó comhar creidmheasa: oscail do bhaincéireacht ar líne féin nó d'aip bhainc.",
  "Waiting for your e-Transfer. This page updates on its own once the payment is received — you can also close it; your order is saved.": "Ag fanacht le do e-Transfer. Nuashonraíonn an leathanach seo leis féin nuair a fhaightear an íocaíocht — is féidir leat é a dhúnadh freisin; tá d'ordú sábháilte.",
  "PAYMENT RECEIVED ✓ — thank you. A receipt will follow by email.": "ÍOCAÍOCHT FAIGHTE ✓ — go raibh maith agat. Seolfar admháil trí ríomhphost.",
  "COPY ORDER DETAILS": "CÓIPEÁIL SONRAÍ AN ORDAITHE",
  "COPIED ✓": "CÓIPEÁILTE ✓",
  "COPY ORDER NUMBER": "CÓIPEÁIL AN UIMHIR ORDAITHE",
  "START A NEW ORDER": "TOSAIGH ORDÚ NUA",
  "Questions about your order or payment? Email us and we reply directly:": "Ceisteanna faoi d'ordú nó d'íocaíocht? Seol ríomhphost chugainn agus freagróimid go díreach:",
  "Generate a payment order and pay COSMOS Ledger Labs Inc. by bank wire, Interac e-Transfer or USDT.": "Cruthaigh ordú íocaíochta agus íoc COSMOS Ledger Labs Inc. le haistriú bainc, Interac e-Transfer nó USDT.",
  "Generate a payment order and pay by bank wire, Interac e-Transfer or USDT.": "Cruthaigh ordú íocaíochta agus íoc le haistriú bainc, Interac e-Transfer nó USDT.",
  "e.g. Lily": "m.sh. Lily",
  "HOW PAYMENT WORKS": "CONAS A OIBRÍONN ÍOCAÍOCHT",
  "Project work is performed under a written agreement, with fees fixed in writing before work begins. Technical consulting is charged at the rates published on our Services page. Payment schedules (deposit and milestones, if any) are set out in the agreement, on the invoice, or in the payment order you generate.": "Déantar obair tionscadail faoi chomhaontú scríofa, le táillí socraithe i scríbhinn sula dtosaíonn an obair. Gearrtar comhairleoireacht theicniúil de réir na rátaí a fhoilsítear ar ár leathanach Seirbhísí. Leagtar amach sceidil íocaíochta (éarlais agus garspriocanna, más ann dóibh) sa chomhaontú, ar an sonrasc, nó san ordú íocaíochta a chruthaíonn tú.",
  "ACCEPTED PAYMENT METHODS": "MODHANNA ÍOCAÍOCHTA A GHLACTAR",
  "We accept payment by bank wire transfer, in USDT (stablecoin), and — within Canada — by Interac e-Transfer. For your security, payment details are not displayed publicly on this website: they are provided when you generate a payment order on our Pay page, or on the official invoice you receive from\ninfo@cosmosledgerlabs.com.": "Glacaimid le híocaíocht trí aistriú bainc, in USDT (stablecoin), agus — laistigh de Cheanada — trí Interac e-Transfer. Ar mhaithe le do shlándáil, ní thaispeántar sonraí íocaíochta go poiblí ar an suíomh seo: tugtar duit iad nuair a chruthaíonn tú ordú íocaíochta ar ár leathanach Íoc, nó ar an sonrasc oifigiúil a fhaigheann tú ó\ninfo@cosmosledgerlabs.com.",
  "We never send payment details through chat apps, social media, or unsolicited email.": "Ní sheolaimid sonraí íocaíochta choíche trí aipeanna comhrá, na meáin shóisialta ná ríomhphost gan iarraidh.",
  "We never ask you to send USDT or any cryptocurrency to a wallet address received in a chat message or social media post. A USDT address is valid only when it is sent from\ninfo@cosmosledgerlabs.com — either in reply to your payment order, or on an official invoice.": "Ní iarraimid ort choíche USDT ná aon chriptea-airgeadra eile a sheoladh chuig seoladh sparáin a fuair tú i dteachtaireacht chomhrá nó i bpostáil ar na meáin shóisialta. Ní bhíonn seoladh USDT bailí ach amháin nuair a sheoltar é ó\ninfo@cosmosledgerlabs.com — mar fhreagra ar d'ordú íocaíochta, nó ar shonrasc oifigiúil.",
  "Other than fees for our own services, we never receive or hold funds for clients or investors, and we never charge success fees or take a percentage of funds raised.": "Seachas táillí as ár seirbhísí féin, ní ghlacaimid ná ní choinnímid cistí do chliaint ná d'infheisteoirí choíche, agus ní ghearraimid táillí ratha ná ní ghlacaimid céatadán de na cistí a bhailítear.",
  "Valid payment details come from only two places: a payment order you generate yourself on this website, and emails — a reply to your order or an official invoice — sent from\ninfo@cosmosledgerlabs.com.": "Ní thagann sonraí íocaíochta bailí ach ó dhá áit: ordú íocaíochta a chruthaíonn tú féin ar an suíomh seo, agus ríomhphoist — freagra ar d'ordú nó sonrasc oifigiúil — a sheoltar ó\ninfo@cosmosledgerlabs.com.",
  "Cryptocurrency transfers cannot be reversed — confirm any USDT address with us by email before sending.": "Ní féidir aistrithe criptea-airgeadra a aisiompú — deimhnigh aon seoladh USDT linn trí ríomhphost sula seolann tú.",
  "A payment request from any other source is fraudulent: do not pay, and forward it to info@cosmosledgerlabs.com.": "Is calaois é iarratas íocaíochta ó aon fhoinse eile: ná híoc, agus cuir ar aghaidh chuig info@cosmosledgerlabs.com é.",
